        "official_en_sha256": "71f12176d50f960846da28869d5ca9af81fd25e32a566c90d42a17487751a194"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "体から少し魔力を感じます！\r\nこれなら魔法が使えるかもしれません！",
        "official_en": "I feel some of my powers coming back to me! Maybe I can cast magic again!",
        "real_en": null
